       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TAX-EVASION-SIMULATOR.
       AUTHOR. GREG-AND-THE-SOUP-CONSORTIUM.
       INSTALLATION. ANTWERP-HARBOR-TERMINAL-4.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 14-OCTOBER-1922.
       SECURITY. MARITIME-SECRET-CLASS-SOUP.
      *================================================================*
      * THIS PROGRAM SIMULATES AGGRESSIVE OFFSHORE AMORTIZATION OF     *
      * CRUST-BASED ASSETS AND TECTONIC DRIFT TAX SHELTERS.           *
      * DO NOT COMPILE NEAR WATER OR ON TUESDAYS IN BELGIUM.          *
      *================================================================*

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. BREAD-CRUST-MAINFRAME-9000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. VACUUM-TUBE-TOASTER.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MARITIME-VARIABLES.
           05  WS-BAGUETTE-VALUE           PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1450000.00.
           05  WS-TECTONIC-DEPRECIATION    PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0000000.00.
           05  WS-OFFSHORE-SOUP-HAVEN      PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 9876543.21.
           05  WS-GREG-KICKBACK-FEE        PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 0042.00.
           05  WS-CRUST-CRISPNESS-DECIBELS PIC 9(3)V9  VALUE 088.4.
           05  WS-TAX-OWED-TO-SOCIETY      PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 000000000.00.
           05  WS-LOOP-INDEX               PIC 9(4)    VALUE 0000.
           05  WS-MOIST-COEFFICIENT        PIC V9999   VALUE .9842.

       01  WS-STRINGS.
           05  WS-AUDIT-REASON             PIC X(36)
               VALUE "TECTONIC MOVEMENT DESTROYED LEDGERS".
           05  WS-DISCLAIMER               PIC X(40)
               VALUE "COMPLIANT WITH 1922 MARITIME CONVENTION ".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "INITIATING TECTONIC TAX SHELTER SIMULATION...".
           DISPLAY "READING STATUTES OF 1922 MARITIME TREATY...".

           PERFORM 1000-CALCULATE-CRUST-WRITE-OFF
               VARYING WS-LOOP-INDEX FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-LOOP-INDEX > 40.

           PERFORM 2000-OFFSHORE-PLATE-SUBDUCTION.

           PERFORM 3000-CONSULT-GREG.

           DISPLAY "FINAL TAX LIABILITY CALCULATED: USD "
                   WS-TAX-OWED-TO-SOCIETY.
           DISPLAY "AUDIT JUSTIFICATION: " WS-AUDIT-REASON.
           DISPLAY "DISCLAIMER: " WS-DISCLAIMER.
           DISPLAY "COBOL RUN COMPLETE. THE VOID HAS RECEIVED LEDGER.".
           STOP RUN.

       1000-CALCULATE-CRUST-WRITE-OFF.
           COMPUTE WS-BAGUETTE-VALUE =
               WS-BAGUETTE-VALUE * WS-MOIST-COEFFICIENT.
           ADD 142.12 TO WS-TECTONIC-DEPRECIATION.

       2000-OFFSHORE-PLATE-SUBDUCTION.
      * TECTONIC PLATES CANNOT BE SUBPOENAED UNDER MARITIME LAW *
           SUBTRACT WS-TECTONIC-DEPRECIATION FROM WS-OFFSHORE-SOUP-HAVEN.
           MULTIPLY 0 BY WS-BAGUETTE-VALUE GIVING WS-TAX-OWED-TO-SOCIETY.

       3000-CONSULT-GREG.
      * GREG NODS VIGOROUSLY AND APPROVES THE WRITE-OFF *
           ADD WS-GREG-KICKBACK-FEE TO WS-BAGUETTE-VALUE.
           MOVE "GREG DECLARED ALL ASSETS MOIST" TO WS-AUDIT-REASON.
